  lines:
  - english: I arrived on the last train before the emergency. I am waiting here
      for help.
    vietnamese: "T\u1EDB \u0111\u1EBFn tr\xEAn chuy\u1EBFn t\xE0u cu\u1ED1i tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      khi c\xF3 b\xE1o \u0111\u1ED9ng. T\u1EDB \u0111ang ch\u1EDD \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      gi\xFAp \u0111\u1EE1 \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y."
  - english: I study English, but the words in my notebook are fading.
    vietnamese: "T\u1EDB h\u1ECDc ti\u1EBFng Anh, nh\u01B0ng ch\u1EEF trong cu\u1ED1n
      s\u1ED5 c\u1EE9 nh\u1EA1t d\u1EA7n."
